In a Vite + React app, editing `Counter.jsx` reloads the whole page and resets the counter's state, instead of hot-swapping it. The file looks like this. What causes the full reload?

```jsx
export const MAX = 10;
export function Counter() {
  const [n, setN] = useState(0);
  return <button onClick={() => setN(n + 1)}>{n}/{MAX}</button>;
}
```
